		"name": "Laravel Buku Bisnis API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Laravel Buku Bisnis (Business Book) Application. This API manages user accounts, categories, transactions, and transfers for personal finance tracking.\n\n## Base URL\nUpdate the {{base_url}} variable with your server URL (e.g., http://localhost:8000)\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require Bearer token authentication. After logging in, the token is automatically saved to the {{auth_token}} variable.\n\n## Features\n- User authentication with Laravel Sanctum\n- Account management (cash, bank, e-wallet)\n- Hierarchical category system\n- Income and expense tracking\n- Transfer between accounts\n- Statistics and reporting",
